## Important Limitation

This project is not yet the final Linux computer.

The SoC must still have several things completed before Linux can run.

For example:

- A suitable RISC-V CPU
- Correct boot behavior
- Sufficient RAM
- Interrupt support
- Timer support
- UART driver support
- Software toolchain
- Bootloader or firmware
- Linux-compatible hardware configuration
- Device tree
- FPGA hardware verification

This project is therefore the hardware foundation for the Linux stage.

